{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Oily Depths</strong> is a short horror game set in a submarine deep beneath the sea. You must locate and drill for oil or your overlords will stop your supply of oxygen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PILOT YOUR SUB</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize all your gauges, meters, and monitors as your visibility is limited within the sub. Carefully navigate the sea floor to locate the oil extraction targets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113030/extras/gif_helm.gif?t=1742982101\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">OPERATE DANGEROUS DRILLING MACHINERY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flip levers, grab tools, set locking-arms, and more. You will need to gain a mastery of each part of your equipment until it's a part of you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113030/extras/gif_rig.gif?t=1742982101\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">AVOID DROWNING, BURNING ALIVE, OR BEING EATEN...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Not our problem. If you don't meet quota... We cut your oxygen.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Corporate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113030/extras/gif_fire.gif?t=1742982101\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3113030?t=1742982101","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3113030?t=1742982101","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113030/d1ec521a5ff6509fed405c33940205a184bee61a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742982101","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113030/d1ec521a5ff6509fed405c33940205a184bee61a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=174298210